# Local assistant/agent state. Machine-local settings that are never part of
# the project and must not become tracked.
.claude/

# Generated FabSim datasets. `fabsim.emit.DATASET_ROOT` defaults here, so a
# build run without an explicit root would otherwise drop hundreds of megabytes
# of observable planes - and their hidden `truth/` siblings - into the working
# tree. They are reproducible from (config, world, seed, version) and belong
# nowhere near a commit.
data/scenarios/

# Note: data/fab.db and data/fab_database.sql are intentionally committed so the
# repo runs immediately on clone (they are also fully regenerable via `make setup`).
